#: index.docbook:57
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&kmix; is an application that allows you to change the volume of your sound "
"card."
msgstr ""
"&kmix;  je aplikacija koja omogućuje promjenu jačine zvuka na zvučnoj "
"kartici."

