#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:75
#, no-c-format
msgid "Introduction"
msgstr "Uvod"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:81
#, no-c-format
msgid "&kmix; supports several platforms and sound drivers."
msgstr "&kmix; podržava nekoliko platformi i zvučnih drivera."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:90
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you have both ALSA and Open Sound System drivers installed, &kmix; will "
"use the ALSA driver."
msgstr ""
"Ako imate oba ALSA i Open Sound System drivere instalirane, &kmix; će "
"koristiti ALSA driver."

